[[Merga]] is a artificial intelligence startup specializing in the field of '''Joint-Embedding Predictive Architecture'''. The company was founded in January 2026 by [[Ubl Weid]] and [[Hendi Manar]], two former researchers of [[Sare (Company)|Sare]]'s artificial intelligence team, focusing on the development of {{w|Generative artificial intelligence#Video|World Models}}. The company raised Ħ1.2 billion Hanti seed from the [[Burawa Domestic Investment Fund]], the largest seed fundraise of any company by the domestic investment fund. The company is valued at [[International Dollar|$]]1.1 billion international dollars (Ħ4.4 billion).